  "help": {
    "format": "restructuredtext",
    "content": "\nFiltlong is a tool for filtering long reads by quality. It can take a set of long reads and produce a smaller, better subset. It uses both read length (longer is better) and read identity (higher is better) when choosing which reads pass the filter.\n    "
  }
